(`*`) instead of the original `/*` patterns"},"179":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-101","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#development-mode","content":"With `--development`, the fixed `lamassu`/`lamassu` password grants `pki-admin` access to anyone who can reach the installation. Never use it on anything exposed beyond a development machine or a network-reachable host."},"180":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-102","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#development-mode","content":"`--development` applies when the `lamassu` realm is first imported. It does not modify an existing cluster. It can be combined with `--sample-data`: the development transform runs first, then sample data is added to the same realm configuration."},"181":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-103","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#what-the-script-configures","content":"Fastlane:"},"182":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-104","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#what-the-script-configures","content":"validates local tools and the selected cluster"},"183":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-105","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#what-the-script-configures","content":"installs or upgrades Envoy Gateway 1.8 and creates the `eg` `GatewayClass`"},"184":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-106","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#what-the-script-configures","content":"creates the namespace"},"185":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-107","p