evice-46","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Include Enrollment CA enabled; Include Lamassu System CA disabled."},"1528":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-47","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configure-the-evaluation-dms","content":"Equal duration and window allow immediate renewal testing. These are evaluation values; size production settings according to connectivity and recovery times. Save, reread both authentication blocks and retain the DMS ID. The console exposes independent editors for the enrollment and re-enrollment authentication; the DMS guide describes their fields, and you can also check the resource through the DMS API."},"1529":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-48","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#prepare-the-client-and-check-cacerts","content":"Place the four trust and bootstrap files in the new directory. Replace the URL with your installation's URL:"},"1530":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-49","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#prepare-the-client-and-check-cacerts","content":"The download must succeed and contain the expected enrollment root. Compare its fingerprint with `device-root.pem`. This check does not turn the response into initial trust or prove that you can issue."},"1531":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-50","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#enroll-the-device","content":"Generate a new key and CSR with the selected identifier:"},"1532":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-51","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#enroll-the-device","content":"Request the identity with the bootstrap credential and extract the certificate from the default response:"},"1533":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-52","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#enroll-the-device","content":"If curl fails, use Troubleshooting with the saved body. Do not convert it or repeat the request without querying inventory: a timeout or error can follow persisted issuance."},"1534":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-53","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#verify-the-obtained-identity","content":"Expect `device.crt: OK` and exit code 0 from `cmp`. Check the CN, serial, dates, Digital Signature and Client Authentication. The certificate must be a leaf: it must not declare `CA:TRUE` or Certificate Sign use. Check that its validity matches the one-hour profile."},"1535":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-54","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#verify-the-obtained-identity","content":"In Lamassu, open `est-device-001`. It must be created with the intended owning DMS, a current identity and the received certificate in its history. Compare the local serial with the slot; thresholds can show a renewal state rather than simply Active."},"1536":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-55","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#demonstrate-an-mtls-connection","content":"In a second terminal, enter the same directory and run `umask 077`. Create a local server certificate and start a test consumer. This server trusts `device-root.pem` and requires a valid client identity:"},"1537":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-56","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#demonstrate-an-mtls-connection","content":"Leave it running. In the first terminal, connect using the obtained identity:"},"1538":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-57","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#demonstrate-an-mtls-connection","content":"Expect HTTP `200`. The client's trust in this local server is its self-signed `consumer.crt`; the server verifies the device against `device-root.pem`. The HTML file displays OpenSSL diagnostic information."},"1539":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-58","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#demonstrate-an-mtls-connection","content":"With the same server still running, test that a request without a client certificate is rejected:"},"1540":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-59","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#demonstrate-an-mtls-connection","content":"Rejection must correspond to a missing certificate at the server, not a stopped server. Stop the consumer with Ctrl+C after the test. This exercise demonstrates TLS authentication and key possession; your application must also define authorization and revocation consumption. Server options are described in openssl-s\\_server."},"1541":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-60","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"Check"},"1542":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-61","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"Expected result"},"1543":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-62","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"Registration"},"1544":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-63","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"ID created automatically and correct DMS."},"1545":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-64","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"Certificate"},"1546":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-65","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"CN, profile, serial and key verified."},"1547":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-66","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"Inventory"},"1548":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-67","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"Received serial visible as the current identity and in history."},"1549":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-68","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"Consumer"},"1550":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-69","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"mTLS responds 200 with the identity and rejects a missing certificate."},"1551":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-70","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"Continue with Renewal and recovery to request a successor pair within the window, install it and repeat the mTLS check. The consumer must use the new files in that test. After checking the successor, retire the previous certificate according to PKI policy; the example does not revoke it automatically."},"1552":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-71","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#result-and-continuity","content":"Devices and identities explains retirement and the limits of historical revocation. For a real destination, prepare consumer trust, validation and permissions; AWS IoT Core is an available integration."},"1553":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"page","content":"Register a device manually","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","IoT Fleets","Getting started"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device"},"1554":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","content":"Prepare a DMS, register a device and associate a verified certificate with its identity."},"1555":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#before-you-begin","content":"Before you begin"},"1556":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"Prepare the DMS"},"1557":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#register-the-device","content":"Register the device"},"1558":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#check-the-initial-status","content":"Check the initial status"},"1559":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#assign-an-identity","content":"Assign an identity"},"1560":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#verify-the-device","content":"Verify the device"},"1561":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#expected-result","content":"Expected result"},"1562":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-8","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#if-the-result-fails","content":"If the result fails"},"1563":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-9","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#automate-the-next-device","content":"Automate the next device"},"1564":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-10","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","content":"This path is intended for those starting to administer device identities. You will register `device-001` and assign an existing certificate to check the relationship between device, DMS and identity history."},"1565":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-11","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","content":"Assignment updates Lamassu's inventory. Install the key and certificate separately on the device; check the connection to a consumer in that destination's integration."},"1566":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-12","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#before-you-begin","content":"An accessible instance and permission to administer DMSs, devices and certificate associations."},"1567":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-13","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#before-you-begin","content":"An active CA with an available key. If one does not exist yet, follow Create your first CA."},"1568":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-14","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#before-you-begin","content":"An active end-entity certificate from that CA whose `Common Name` is exactly `device-001`, together with its private key. Follow Issue and verify a certificate to obtain and check both."},"1569":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-15","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#before-you-begin","content":"The identifier `device-001` available in the inventory. If you already used it, choose another and issue the certificate with that same `Common Name`."},"1570":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-16","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"A DMS must exist before registering the device. If you already have a suitable one, check its CA and note its identifier; to create one:"},"1571":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-17","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"Open the DMS inventory and its creation action. Assign a recognizable name, such as `Acme Evaluation DMS`."},"1572":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-18","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"In **Enrollment CA**, select the CA that issued `device.crt`."},"1573":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-19","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"In **Registration Mode**, select `PRE_REGISTRATION` for the path that starts with explicit registration."},"1574":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-20","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"In the authentication section, enable **Require client certificate** and leave **Call external webhook** off. Under **Require client certificate**, add the CA whose initial certificates you will accept to **Validation CAs**; for this evaluation, it can be the same CA. Keep **Verify CSR Signature** enabled and leave **Enable server-side key generation** off if you will not use it."},"1575":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-21","page_id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"Review renewal and trust distribution settings with the DMS guide, save the service and note its identifier."},"1576":{"id":"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-22","page_id"