erial was copied."],[803,"**Expired**"],[801,"**Expiring Soon**"],[2658,"**Find the new StatefulSets and PVCs.** Their names depend on the release name and any `nameOverride` or `fullnameOverride`; the PVC name is `<volumeClaimTemplate>-<StatefulSet name>-0`:"],[1455,"**Fleet**"],[2153,"**Generate CSR** to create a PKCS#10 request with the selected key."],[1780,"**Generate Key & CSR in Browser** is useful for a manual operation or a quick test. The browser generates the key and you must download it at the end."],[538,"**Global actions** do not need a resource identifier. `create`, `import` or access to a console section are common examples."],[977,"**Go to DMS owned devices** restricts inventory by owner. **Show/Edit Metadata** contains operational and integration data; consult the integration guide before changing it. &#x2A;*EST (RFC-7030)** helps locate URLs."],[672,"**HTTP Authentication** selects `No Authentication` (the default), `API Key` (API key value and Header Name, `X-API-Key` by default), `OIDC Client Credentials` (Client ID, Client Secret and Well-Known URL) or `Mutual TLS` (Client Certificate and Client Private Key pasted as PEM). A stored private key stays hidden until you select **Show**."],[1581,"**Icon** and **Tags**: optional classification."],[1451,"**Identity**"],[1741,"**Import a CA with its private key:** incorporate an external authority that Lamassu can issue with."],[1742,"**Import only the certificate:** register public material. If Lamassu finds its key in the KMS, it can associate it; otherwise, the CA has no usable key for issuance."],[971,"**Include Enrollment CA**"],[969,"**Include Lamassu System CA**"],[2662,"**Inspect before writing** so you do not clobber data the new pods may already have written:"],[1849,"**Intermediate CA**\\\n`Sign as CA`, `CertSign` and `CRLSign`, validity longer than its end-entity certificates and stricter cryptographic constraints."],[682,"**Invalid configurations are rejected at subscribe time.** A channel