falla con las claves antiguas"},"2533":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-78","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Mover JWKS y roles a `services.authz`"},"2534":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-79","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Consolidación en PostgreSQL"},"2535":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-80","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Despliegues 3.8.0 con bases de datos por servicio"},"2536":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-81","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Alta: los servicios no encuentran datos, o una migración aborta"},"2537":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-82","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Limpiar antes IDs de CA duplicados y `engine_id` vacíos; fuera de Helm, mover los datos a mano"},"2538":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-83","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Retirada de SQLite"},"2539":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-84","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Despliegues sobre SQLite, `couch_db` o `dynamo_db`"},"2540":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-85","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Alta: el backend ya no arranca con ellos"},"2541":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-86","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Pasar a PostgreSQL antes de actualizar"},"2542":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-87","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Webhooks con referencias a archivos"},"2543":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-88","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"DMS cuyo certificado o clave mTLS del webhook eran rutas de archivo"},"2544":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-89","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Alta: los enrolamientos que llaman al webhook fallan"},"2545":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-90","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Volver a introducir certificado y clave como PEM, o eliminar los campos de archivo"},"2546":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-91","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Contenedores sin root"},"2547":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-92","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Releases con identidades por servicio o material de claves montado"},"2548":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-93","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Media: los servicios no pueden leer sus archivos"},"2549":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-94","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Eliminar las sobrescrituras y corregir la propiedad de los volúmenes"},"2550":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-95","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"AMQP sobre TLS"},"2551":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-96","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Releases que definen `amqp.tls`"},"2552":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-97","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Media: los clientes se conectan al puerto equivocado"},"2553":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-98","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Apuntar `amqp.port` al listener TLS, o desactivar TLS"},"2554":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-99","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Claves de CA heredadas en el KMS"},"2555":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-100","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Instalaciones cuyas claves de CA son anteriores al KMS"},"2556":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-101","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Media: las claves de CA quedan sin gestionar"},"2557":{"id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0-102","page_id":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0#breaking-changes","content":"Ejecutar la migración de CA a KMS